    # ren "I'd be a lot better if I wasn't stuck in these damn handcuffs."
    ren "要是没被这该死的手铐铐着，我会好受多了。"

# game/po_p2p2.rpy:20
translate Chinese rhearude02_calm01_890b5649:

    # ren "So why don't you figure out how to get these stupid cuffs off me!"
    ren "那你倒是想办法把这破手铐弄掉啊！"

# game/po_p2p2.rpy:22
translate Chinese rhearude02_calm01_54823149:

    # wi "I can't do that, and there must be a reason the cops cuffed you. It doesn't exactly make you trustworthy."
    wi "我做不到。警察铐你肯定有原因，这可没法让我信任你。"

# game/po_p2p2.rpy:24
translate Chinese rhearude02_calm01_6a63072a:

    # ren "It's personal. Those nosy cops meddled and got my friends killed."
    ren "这是我的私事。那些多管闲事的警察插手，害死了我的朋友。"

# game/po_p2p2.rpy:26
translate Chinese rhearude02_calm01_d0b2cbf0:

    # wi "I'm sorry about your friend. Truly."
    wi "听说你朋友的事，我很抱歉。是真心话。"

# game/po_p2p2.rpy:28
translate Chinese rhearude02_calm01_c870181d:

    # ren "You wouldn't get it. You've got your little sister and your girl. My friend was all I had."
    ren "你不会懂的。你有妹妹，还有你的女人。可我的朋友，就是我的全部。"

# game/po_p2p2.rpy:30
translate Chinese rhearude02_calm01_a863e23a:

    # wi "I don't know what you've been through, but I'm not your enemy. We're stuck together for now, so let's make the most of it."
    wi "我不知道你经历过什么，但我不是你的敌人。我们现在被困在一起了，不如既来之则安之。"

# game/po_p2p2.rpy:35
translate Chinese rhearude02_calm01_daaa75db:

    # ren "Fine. Don't think this makes us friends, soldier boy. Get out of my face."
    ren "行吧。别以为这样我们就是朋友了，大兵。滚开，别烦我。"

